
Approach:

The work I completed in two hours is provided in DMOND copy.zip. It is a small snapshot of a still-nascent stage of fulfilling the exercise requirements: I was unhappy with that result and wanted to see it through once I had started.

- Follow the requirements faithfully in an MVVM Objective-C 
- UIKit application with a programmatic user interface in Autolayout.

Features:

- Slot machine
- Reward screen
- Game state data: credits available
- Game state: credits arithmetic when user wins. 
- very minor apple system audio queues

No assumptions were made 

Instructions to run:
- Application constructed on Xcode version 26.6. 
- Application tested on simulator: iPad Pro 11-Inch. 

